```Scheduled Task Created to Run a Script Interpreter | sigma: rules/windows/persistence/proc_creation_schtasks_create_interpreter_action.yml```
`dac_windows_process_creation` Image="*\\schtasks.exe" OR OriginalFileName="schtasks.exe" CommandLine="* -create *" OR CommandLine="* /create *" OR CommandLine="* –create *" OR CommandLine="* —create *" OR CommandLine="* ―create *" CommandLine="* -tr *" OR CommandLine="* /tr *" OR CommandLine="* –tr *" OR CommandLine="* —tr *" OR CommandLine="* ―tr *" CommandLine IN ("*powershell*", "*pwsh*", "*cmd.exe /c*", "*cmd /c*", "*wscript*", "*cscript*", "*mshta*", "*rundll32*")
